{%- comment -%}
  A wa.me click-to-chat link with a message already typed, or nothing when no
  WhatsApp number is set under Theme settings > Social. wa.me wants the number
  as digits only, so the "+", spaces and dashes a merchant types are removed.

  Accepts:
    message - required, plain text; it is URL-encoded here
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.social_whatsapp != blank -%}
  {%- assign digits = settings.social_whatsapp | remove: '+' | remove: ' ' | remove: '-' -%}
  https://wa.me/{{ digits }}?text={{ message | url_encode }}
{%- endif -%}
